See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt and LICENSES/MIT.txt for the texts, and
REUSE.toml for the per-file inventory.

Large parts of wuffada are derived from Wuffs
(https://github.com/google/wuffs), which is distributed under the same two
licenses: the generated decoders (ada/gen) are translations of Wuffs'
standard library, the proved base libraries (ada/src) are ports of Wuffs'
C base library, and the generator (internal/adagen) follows Wuffs' C
back-end. Those parts are also copyright The Wuffs Authors.
